---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';

const relationLabels = [
  ['competes-with', '同じ土俵'],
  ['alternative-to', '代替候補'],
  ['works-with', '組み合わせ'],
  ['built-on', '土台'],
  ['runs-on', '実行場所'],
  ['implements', '実装する規格'],
  ['part-of', '一部を構成'],
] as const;
---
<aside class="atlas-inspector" data-atlas-inspector aria-live="polite">
  <div class="atlas-inspector-head">
    <div>
      <div class="meta-label accent-label">RELATIONSHIP INSPECTOR</div>
      <h2>関係を見る</h2>
    </div>
    <button class="atlas-reset" type="button" data-atlas-reset disabled>Reset focus</button>
  </div>

  <div class="atlas-inspector-empty" data-atlas-empty>
    <p>技術を選ぶと、直接つながる技術だけを表示します。</p>
    <span>同じ土俵か、組み合わせる相手か、土台かを一つずつ確認できます。</span>
  </div>

  <div class="atlas-inspector-active" data-atlas-active hidden>
    <div class="atlas-focus-title">
      <span class="meta-label" data-atlas-focus-category></span>
      <h3 data-atlas-focus-name></h3>
      <p data-atlas-focus-description></p>
      <a class="section-link" data-atlas-focus-detail href={withBase('/technologies')}>技術詳細を見る →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="atlas-no-relations" data-atlas-no-relations hidden>現在の絞り込み条件では、直接関係は未登録です。技術詳細を開くか、絞り込みを解除して確認してください。</p>
    <div class="atlas-relation-groups">
      {relationLabels.map(([type, label]) => (
        <section class="atlas-relation-group" data-atlas-relation-group={type} hidden>
          <div class="atlas-relation-heading">
            <span class={`relation-swatch relation-${type}`} aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <h4>{label}</h4>
            <span data-atlas-relation-count>0</span>
          </div>
          <ul data-atlas-relation-list></ul>
        </section>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="atlas-legend" aria-label="関係の凡例">
    {relationLabels.map(([type, label]) => (
      <span><i class={`relation-swatch relation-${type}`} aria-hidden="true"></i>{label}</span>
    ))}
  </div>
</aside>
